WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:04.510 line:95%,end
Hi, I'm Alexander Törnqvist, CEO of digiPlant.

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:08.694 line:95%,end
We develop and manage SBS Manager –

00:00:08.694 --> 00:00:11.790 line:95%,end
the right funds to the right recipients –

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:19.570 line:95%,end
for organisations such as foundations, authorities and non-profits.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:26.140 line:95%,end
Our thinking about a larger context has been going on for almost five years –

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:34.380 line:95%,end
the last three years in closer dialogue with several players we have approached ourselves.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:39.380 line:95%,end
Our goal has been to end up in a better,

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:45.900 line:95%,end
larger context, with like-minded companies, where we can gain muscle and take the next step.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:54.100 line:95%,end
Not least the muscle needed to operate in the public sector market,

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:58.880 line:95%,end
and to handle inquiries, tenders and so on.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:05.050 line:95%,end
For us as a small company, there are big challenges in handling and

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:08.350 line:95%,end
keeping up with the larger public tenders coming onto the market.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:12.100 line:95%,end
We see that we will face even bigger challenges in the future.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:17.520 line:95%,end
We chose PubliX specifically because we believe in the business idea –

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:20.800 line:95%,end
that there is a public sector for players like us.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:25.040 line:95%,end
We see inquiries aimed specifically at us,

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:30.400 line:95%,end
which historically never came our way at all.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:38.120 line:95%,end
So at PubliX we see a context with a strong focus on that market,

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:46.340 line:95%,end
where together we become stronger and can build something stable and strong for the future.

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:53.440 line:95%,end
For my part, I see the company gaining muscle –

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:58.760 line:95%,end
financial muscle, of course, but also skills and knowledge exchange,

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:00.560 line:95%,end
which is very important for us.
